### ==================== 变量 ====================
# 先用 loginTest.http 的用例1或2登录，拿到 token 替换下面
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI1IiwiaWF0IjoxNzc4MjM0MDk0LCJleHAiOjE3NzgyNDEyOTR9.bw_h890cadNqzyF0uRRY2hjrQFYrRZpXzcnXkI09pe8


### ==================== 正常发评论 ====================

### 1. 正常发评论（无父评论）
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "这是一条测试评论"
}


### 2. 正常回复评论（带 parentId）
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "这是一条回复",
  "parentId": 46
}


### ==================== 异常 — 鉴权 ====================

### 3. 缺少 token
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/comment/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "未登录评论"
}


### 4. 伪造 token
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/comment/add
token: fake-token-12345
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "假 token 评论"
}


### ==================== 异常 — 参数缺失/非法 ====================

### 5. 缺少 contentId
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "没有 contentId"
}


### 6. 缺少 message
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1
}


### 7. message 为空字符串
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": ""
}


### 8. contentId 为不存在的值
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 99999,
  "message": "对不存在的内容的评论"
}


### ==================== 异常 — parentId 非法 ====================

### 9. parentId 指向不存在的评论
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "回复不存在的评论",
  "parentId": 99999
}


### 10. parentId 与 contentId 不匹配（父评论不属于该内容）
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/comment/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "跨内容回复",
  "parentId": 5
}


### ==================== 异常 — 路由 ====================

### 11. 未识别的 action
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/comment/unknown
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": 1,
  "message": "test"
}